  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/banner-vulcans-flashlights.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<br><span style=\"color:#f90\"><strong>開發暫緩，短期內不會繼續。<br>目前 SWE/M 團隊無法投入時間修復、移植或升級此模組。<br>造成不便，敬請見諒。我們未來仍會回歸此專案，但尚無確切時間表。</strong></span><br><br><br></p><h4><strong>新增內容 - <em><span style=\"color:#930;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">包含哪些物品？</span></em></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>手電筒</li>\n<li>超級手電筒</li>\n<li>礦工頭盔</li>\n<li>超級礦工頭盔</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>合成配方 - <em><span style=\"color:#930;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">如何製作它們！</span></em></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">手電筒：</span></strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/jV7image.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超級手電筒：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/1CQimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#f00\">---&gt;</span>&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>礦工頭盔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/928956/description_a9706ec4-a716-4c92-8024-ad556ba207ea.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>---&gt;</strong></span><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>超級礦工頭盔：</strong></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://wiki.swequestrian.com/uploads/images/gallery/2026-01/scaled-1680-/ZLFimage.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:14px;color:#f00\"><strong>如何充電？</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>使用<span style=\"color:#f00\">紅石</span>粉修復手電筒，使用<span style=\"color:#f00\">紅石</span>方塊修復超級手電筒。無需鐵砧。</em></li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>功能 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><em><span style=\"color:#930\">它們有什麼作用？</span></em></span></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>手電筒和頭盔能在黑暗環境中引導你穿越洞穴和海洋，無需不斷放置火把或螢石</li>\n<li>低電量時會閃爍</li>\n<li>特定物品/生物可能導致閃爍或加速耗電</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4><strong>設定選項 - <span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;color:#930\"><em>如何調整特定功能？</em></span></strong></h4><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>我們提供許多可選功能，你可以透過設定檔來自訂模組！（若不熟悉，可在 YouTube 搜尋「如何修改模組設定檔」獲得協助！）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>啟用/關閉閃爍功能</li>\n<li>啟用/關閉閃爍外觀（適合感官敏感者）</li>\n<li>設定方塊/生物清單及其閃爍倍率</li>\n<li>設定方塊/生物清單及其耗電倍率</li>\n<li>閃爍範圍（方塊/生物開始觸發閃爍效果的距離）</li>\n<li>耗電範圍（方塊/生物開始觸發耗電效果的距離）</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p><strong>----------------------------------------------------------------</strong></p><p><strong><em>致謝：</em></strong><br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;製作總監&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;1.20 開發者&nbsp; ||&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong>Quarris<strong><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;著色器&nbsp; ||&nbsp; </strong>AlexModGuy（參照 Alex's Caves，LGPL）<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;資源與材質&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>AlaharranHonor<br><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;委託人&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>Vulcan</p><p><em><strong>權利、模組包與影片：</strong></em></p><p style=\"padding-left:30px\"><strong>權利&nbsp; ||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>LGPL 3.0<br><strong>模組包&nbsp; &nbsp;||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>無需標註來源，但請聯絡我們，讓我們也能一起遊玩！<br><strong>影片&nbsp; &nbsp; ||&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>請告知我們，以便分享給朋友！</p>",
